@startuml ad-01-purchase-journey
!include ../_style.iuml
title AD-01 · Customer purchase journey (UC-01 → UC-05)

|Customer|
start
:Open the store;
|Web app (View)|
:Load filters and active products;
if (Catalog loaded?) then (no)
  :Show error + "Tentar de novo";
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Show a card for each stored order\nstill awaiting pickup (see AD-02);
:Show product cards with stock state;
|Customer|
repeat
  :Optionally select a filter;
  :Choose quantity on an available product;
  |Web app (View)|
  :Limit quantity to min(stock, 20)\n(BR-05, BR-06);
  :Add / merge into browser cart,\nupdate badge, show toast (BR-17);
  |Customer|
repeat while (Add more cupcakes?) is (yes)
->no;
:Open cart;
|Web app (View)|
:Refresh products; adjust or remove lines\nwhose stock changed (BR-17);
if (Cart empty?) then (yes)
  :Show empty cart + "Ver cupcakes";
  stop
else (no)
endif
:Show lines (photo, qty, line total),\nsubtotal and total (BR-07, BR-08);
|Customer|
:Edit quantities / remove items (optional);
:Continue to checkout;
|Web app (View)|
:Show form, pickup address, ready time\n(from the opening hours, BR-12), "Pagamento na loja"\nand full order summary;
repeat
  |Customer|
  :Enter / correct name and phone;
  |Web app (View)|
  :Validate fields (BR-14);
repeat while (Any field invalid?) is (yes: show field messages) not (no)
:Send POST /api/orders;
|API (Controller + Model)|
:Expire overdue orders and release\ntheir stock (BR-20);
:Re-validate data and products;
:In one transaction: decrement stock atomically,\nupsert customer, compute ready time and pickup\ndeadline, create order AWAITING_PICKUP\n(UC-07, BR-10, BR-11, BR-12, BR-15);
if (Created?) then (no)
  :Return error\n(VALIDATION_ERROR / PRODUCT_NOT_FOUND /\nINSUFFICIENT_STOCK);
  |Web app (View)|
  :Show affected items; back to cart;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Web app (View)|
:Clear cart (BR-17); add the order code\nto the browser's active orders (BR-19);
:Show Meu pedido: "Pedido feito!", ready time,\ncode, items, total to pay at the store,\naddress and pickup deadline;
|Customer|
:Go to the store between the ready time\nand the pickup deadline;
:Show the code, pay at the counter,\ncollect the order (see AD-03);
stop
@enduml
